              <div class="story-text">
                <p style="font-size:1.125rem;">Poopy Poochy is a recurring, route-based service across St. Clair County. Customers search for someone who covers their specific town, and they want a price before they call — so a brochure site would have failed on both counts.</p>
                <p style="margin-top:1rem;">We built a custom WordPress theme rather than assembling a page builder. That kept the markup clean and fast, and let the site's structured data be generated from the very same fields the owner edits — one source of truth for customers and search engines alike.</p>
